/**
 * ENGAGEMENT AGENT: Community Response System
 *
 * Deploys rotating NEUROMESH agents to reply to comments and reviews across
 * all channels. Every reply is generated by Claude, sanitised for UK English,
 * and checked for banned characters before posting via Composio.
 *
 * Platforms covered:
 *   YouTube Main    (@bbmw.0)          - comments on all videos
 *   YouTube Games   (@BBMW0 Games)     - comments on game videos
 *   Instagram       (@ai_game_odyssey) - comments on all posts
 *   Google Play     (all published apps) - review replies
 *
 * Language policy:
 *   - All English responses use United Kingdom English spelling and grammar
 *   - If a comment is written in a language other than English, the reply is
 *     in that same language (auto-detected by Claude)
 *   - Em dashes (U+2014), smart quotes, and non-standard Unicode are stripped
 *
 * Agent rotation:
 *   Personas cycle across the NEUROMESH pool so replies look organic.
 *   Games channel uses Pixel/Forge personas. Main/IG use growth/content agents.
 *
 * Engagement log:
 *   results/engagement-log.json tracks every replied comment ID so the agent
 *   never double-replies.
 */

